Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.87,0:00:10.57,Top,,0,0,0,,真島一伙已通過第一預測點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.19,0:00:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你能回來太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,現在第二展望台電梯已切斷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 我一直想對你說
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:21.86,Top,,0,0,0,,特攻隊通過四個緊急出口進攻第二展望台
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,把千束叫來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,請坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.71,0:00:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,司令 千束她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,她不來 聯絡不上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,聯絡不上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,店長也是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.43,0:00:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.22,0:00:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,和我們無關
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.91,0:00:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,開著會呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.65,0:00:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,這種狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.15,0:00:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,和他們聯絡不上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.09,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,絕對有問題
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.46,0:00:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.13,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我作戰前回來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.49,0:00:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,沒帶手機吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.29,0:00:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,之後除了我的通信都不能接入
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:00:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,聽從誘導
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:01:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了 快點吧Robota
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟是超越核桃的最強駭客
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.21,0:01:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.71,0:01:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,出發
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.80,0:01:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,沒接
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.74,0:03:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,候機室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.02,0:03:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,頭回體會和你一起的好處
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,該走了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,先不說我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.74,0:03:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你不應該最後陪著千束嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.49,0:03:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,時間足夠長了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.92,0:03:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你倒是糾結什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.57,0:03:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,都在LycoReco那麼熟了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好愉快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.81,0:03:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,這是我們最後一次見面嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.79,0:03:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.15,0:03:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝頭等艙的票
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.87,0:03:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你的是經濟艙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.89,0:03:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.31,0:03:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,關店
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.21,0:04:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.68,0:04:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.31,0:04:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,30分鐘後再突入
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,快回來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.64,0:04:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,千束不在店裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.53,0:04:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,手機也留在店裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.48,0:04:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.19,0:04:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是真島的陰謀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,何出此言
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,之前和真島說的吉松是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,千束的恩人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.95,0:04:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,心臟的提供者嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.85,0:04:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.99,0:04:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,真島知道千束在找吉松
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.37,0:04:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,真島在延空木
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.47,0:04:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,想知道就去問本人去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.75,0:04:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,要趕在他死前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.74,0:04:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,這就回去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.74,0:05:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,和千束心臟最接近的是哪個
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,查出這個著者
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.34,0:05:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,反正是假名
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,用臉部數據代替元數據
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.71,0:05:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,飛行時請別使用好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,反正飛不了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.11,0:05:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,對上了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,鎖定地區
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.63,0:05:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有數據
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.55,0:05:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,十年前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.47,0:05:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,小鎮工廠嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有線索嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.95,0:05:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,類似吉松的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.37,0:05:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,解析波形
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.62,0:05:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,打開聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,直接見面是禁止的吧 吉松先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.19,0:06:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我發現了上等實驗素材
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.34,0:06:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,用骨骼數據
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,然後對照十年內
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,去年？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,多虧了亞倫的支援
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.88,0:06:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,只是盡了綿薄之力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.77,0:06:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,如果用少女的生命換來你的才能也值了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.03,0:06:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你能用這個拯救她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你只要關心未來的患者就好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.81,0:06:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,實驗交給我們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.59,0:06:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她和你一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.20,0:06:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,也是亞倫兒童
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.77,0:06:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是這件嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:06:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.80,0:07:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,您好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.53,0:07:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,您失散的女兒在等你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,女兒？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:10.72,Top,,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:12.01,Top,,0,0,0,,瑞希
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.01,0:07:13.32,Top,,0,0,0,,下飛機
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不認識
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我還得和溫哥華的男友聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.01,0:07:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,還沒交往吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.87,0:07:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,千束的心臟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,還有一台
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.25,0:07:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.47,0:07:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,大概在吉鬆手上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:34.14,Top,,0,0,0,,肌肉要廢了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,被亞倫支援的研究者做出了改良版
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,然後交給吉松了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,走錯了 是這邊瑞希
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.72,0:07:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,別命令我 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.11,0:07:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,吉松現在在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.57,0:07:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,這幾天的蹤跡全無
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.28,0:07:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,再見了 達令
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:07:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,之後再聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.75,0:07:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 胡桃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.95,0:07:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我去了趟LycoReco
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.62,0:08:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.61,0:08:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,關店了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.94,0:08:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 千束決定的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.20,0:08:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,她把手機落在店裡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.83,0:08:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,千束和店長都不在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.67,0:08:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,能解析這個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.35,0:08:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.03,0:08:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他們來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.67,0:08:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,準備好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,駭客
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.55,0:08:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,萬事俱備
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.23,0:08:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我們絕對可以
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.32,0:08:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.80,0:08:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,第二幕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.06,0:08:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,只能走這條路嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.43,0:08:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,各路特攻隊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.37,0:09:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,通過四個緊急出口到達第二展望台後
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,奪回被真島控制的東西南北四個電梯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.76,0:09:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,第一展望台待機組順次上行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.31,0:09:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,匯合後殲滅真島
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,殺無赦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.07,0:09:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,一個別放過
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.39,0:09:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,無法目視敵方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.31,0:09:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈 看千束的手機
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,圖片發送到這個手機
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.64,0:09:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,然後接到了吉松的電話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,現在三賀的車在押上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,可能他們在去舊電視塔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.18,0:09:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就是說千束在去心臟持有者那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.43,0:09:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈 全都解決了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.59,0:09:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.62,0:09:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有不祥的預感
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.52,0:09:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,千束沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,絕對有蹊蹺
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,走快點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.86,0:10:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我們要落後了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.03,0:10:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 就此別過
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.48,0:10:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,又怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.27,0:10:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我去找千束
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,被笨蛋傳染了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,還有任務呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.76,0:10:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂斗 讓她去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.69,0:10:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我接替瀧奈的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,沒戲唱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,再說她被開除的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,還不是因為你的失誤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,對 全是我的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.73,0:10:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那時真的抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,艾麗卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.22,0:10:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.91,0:10:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,事實如此
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,放棄任務你就回不了DA了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:10:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:10:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,這是最後的機會
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.29,0:11:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,在這裡救不了千束
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.69,0:11:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,僅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.15,0:11:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.96,0:11:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼給司令部報告啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,徵集意見
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好 電梯下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.01,0:11:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,因為她讓別隊立了頭功
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.15,0:11:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,這不是比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就是比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.02,0:12:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼離譜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.28,0:12:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,啟動電梯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.63,0:12:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpha小隊已到達
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.16,0:12:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,幫咱隊開了不就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.21,0:12:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.40,0:12:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,一決高下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.12,0:12:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Radiata
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.95,0:12:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,喲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.14,0:12:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,又開始了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼又被劫持了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.61,0:12:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Radiata應對不暇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.40,0:12:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.28,0:12:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,從外部
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,雖說有點難以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.82,0:12:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,因為大量的攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.39,0:12:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,資源已全被系統防禦占用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.23,0:12:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,過度防禦成了累贅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,見識一下我的能力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.57,0:13:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,都內百人初次體驗到槍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,享受到初次的自由了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,還是享受時被小女孩打斷了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.18,0:13:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,注意這些穿制服的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.50,0:13:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她們正是國家秘密組織的特務
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Lycoris
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.97,0:13:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,為了維持日本的和平神話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.45,0:13:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,而無所不用其極的人們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.23,0:13:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,無論什麼手段
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,光是影片還難以置信嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.05,0:14:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟捏造還是很簡單的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.02,0:14:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但你沒在街上見過嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.28,0:14:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,貨真價實的Lycoris
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.14,0:14:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,親眼見到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.96,0:14:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,貫徹禁止開火的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.15,0:14:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Radiata呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,重啟需要時間
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,要重啟嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.33,0:14:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,國家每年3000人下落不明
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.89,0:14:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,3000人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有多少人是被Lycoris抹除了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,說不定還有看到Lycoris的你們
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,只要自己幸福不自然不平衡也無所謂嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我們要從自詡為神的傢伙手中奪回自然的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,這段影片也會被抹除吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.94,0:14:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 記住你親眼所見
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.23,0:14:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是現實
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.76,0:15:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是他們垮台的開始
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.49,0:15:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,本部 請求指示
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.17,0:15:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好好看路啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.48,0:15:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,防禦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.89,0:15:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,與延空木的Lycoris失去聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.07,0:15:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.39,0:15:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那我去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.77,0:15:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真的一個人去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.26,0:15:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.76,0:15:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,回店裡喝茶吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.90,0:15:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,替我問候伸二
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.69,0:15:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.81,0:15:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.70,0:15:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.55,0:15:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡 好貴的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.75,0:15:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,她進去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.46,0:15:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好 第三幕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.02,0:16:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好了各位
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.12,0:16:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,開溜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.43,0:16:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.59,0:16:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,在樓梯摔了會死的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.93,0:16:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要小心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.93,0:16:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,從這出去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.43,0:16:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好險
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.45,0:17:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.75,0:17:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.76,0:17:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好險
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.16,0:17:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好樣的 加把勁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.71,0:17:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,做得不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.62,0:17:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,又到這裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.32,0:18:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,吉叔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.93,0:18:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,千束來了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.35,0:18:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.89,0:18:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,吉叔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.31,0:18:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,喲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.29,0:18:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真島
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:18:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,吉叔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.39,0:19:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,躲開的話吉叔就要中彈了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.36,0:19:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.84,0:19:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼在這嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.39,0:19:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,畫面是延空木中的槍戰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.71,0:19:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,武裝的少女正不斷開槍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.21,0:19:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂斗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.15,0:19:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那邊的Lycoris正全國首秀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.65,0:19:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,這下你們完了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.25,0:20:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,能看見嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.30,0:20:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,能聽到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,根據對方的微動預測射擊和彈道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.16,0:20:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好強啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.12,0:20:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,怪不得亞倫那麼用心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.54,0:20:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,聲音嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.70,0:20:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,正確的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.97,0:20:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你全依賴視覺
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.99,0:21:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,這是實彈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.92,0:21:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我聽吉叔說了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.19,0:21:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,因為無聊的執著發揮不了才能
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但我喜歡你這點
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我也討厭別人干預我的生活方式
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.87,0:21:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,別相提並論
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.44,0:21:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,來聯手對抗亞倫機關嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.21,0:21:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,吉叔怎麼拷問也不肯開口啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.29,0:21:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我們說不定能聯手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.66,0:22:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不都說了沒你的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:47.43,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,360)\blur7.5}君が持ってきた漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:50.43,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}くれた知らない名前のお花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.72,0:22:53.06,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}今日はまだ来ないかな?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.18,0:22:56.43,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}初めての感情知ってしまった
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.89,0:23:02.36,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}窓に飾った絵画をなぞってひとりで宇宙を旅して
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.48,0:23:07.70,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}それだけでいいはずだったのに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.70,0:23:14.04,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}君の手を握ってしまったら
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.37,0:23:20.25,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}孤独を知らないこの街には
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.25,0:23:31.01,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}もう二度と帰ってくることはできないのでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:42.40,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}君が手を差し伸べた　光で影が生まれる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.52,0:23:48.24,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}歌って聞かせてこの話の続き
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.24,0:23:57.25,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}連れて行って見たことない星まで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:47.43,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,360)\blur7.5}你送我的漫畫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:50.43,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}和不知名的花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.72,0:22:53.06,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}今天還沒來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.18,0:22:56.43,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}這種感情初次體驗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.89,0:23:02.36,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}在窗上臨摹塗鴉  獨自前往星辰大海
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.48,0:23:07.70,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}我本該心滿意足
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.70,0:23:14.04,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}直到握住你的手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.37,0:23:20.25,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}在這不懂孤獨的街道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.25,0:23:31.01,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}已經再也回不到從前了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:42.40,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}你伸出了手  光影伴生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.52,0:23:48.24,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}聽我歌唱 聽我訴說
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.24,0:23:57.25,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}帶我去未知的星球
